      ],
      "title": "别忘了带上好运·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41301001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "爱猫社区，登月抽选箱附近。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "唔——！还差一点，还差……一点点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "报名票成功落到抽选箱里了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼，这样也算报名成功了呢，而且从楼上往下扔的时候也没有被人类发现。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "总之先借用了|101|的名字投票。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "是的，说不定这一票就是最lucky的~毕竟有|101|的名字，感觉得到了力量的说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "说起来，抽选箱附近这么多人类，不愧是最近的热门活动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "嘿嘿，毕竟那可是月球，是太空的说！！！大家肯定都很期待吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "这倒是没错。而且最近的漫画也有很多太空科幻的题材啊……唔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "恭介学长？怎么突然一脸严肃？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "这么多人投票，就意味着参与的抽选的手办数量也会非常庞大，中选的机会太小了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "呜……确，确实是这样的，而且现在投票数也在不断增加……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "果然还是不能太期待……吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "哼，这么轻易放弃可不是「Little Busters」啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇！不愧是恭介学长，是有什么特别的计划吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "那当然是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "提高幸运值！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哎……？幸运值……是什么的说？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "是从其他手办的那里听来的，据说只要做好事，自己的幸运值就会提高。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "提高幸运值的话，自然就可以……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "中奖，登月，哇呼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "正是如此，那么，提高幸运值，mission start——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "出发的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301024",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "爱猫社区，广告屏下方。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "这下……呼……可以算是mission complete了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "呼……真的不行了，果然手办捡一天的垃圾也会累啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "但，但是感觉积攒到了很多很多的幸运值呢，双手在发烫，是幸运值的力量的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "这下幸运值一定刷刷往上涨……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "剩下就是看看街道的广告屏幕上的抽奖结果了的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "快，好像开始了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "第一位登月手办的序号为：388347！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "可恶，不过这才第一个，接下来才是正戏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "第二位登月手办的序号为：983403！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "紧张得手都在发抖呢，哇呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301035",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "接下来，就是最后一位登月手办的序号——就是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "咕噜……（咽口水）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "咕噜……（咽口水）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "广播",
          "text": "232424——！恭喜——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "这不是完全没中吗——？可恶——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "……恭介学长？已经僵住十分钟了，难道是灵魂随着打击消失了吗？这可糟糕了的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "竟然被抽选阻挡了……！登月的梦想怎么会被区区抽选阻挡，这样的话还不如自己找方法……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "嗯？自己找方法……？对啊，手办登月肯定还有别的方法！能美，我想到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301044",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "我们自己想方法上月球，我宣布「Little Busters！月球漫步会！」成立！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301045",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "欸？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "第一个任务，招募成员，就交给你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41301047",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼——？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1013",
